corporate as possible.

00:00:21.195 --> 00:00:23.910
The big 2020 initiative
from Rhett and Link is

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:27.120
vlogging on the

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:31.140
long term fallow

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:31.973
Rhett and Link channel.

00:00:31.973 --> 00:00:32.880
