00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:34.100
I thought you were
gonna say something else

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:35.477
when you started saying fallow.

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:39.163
Long term fallow.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:41.800
I don't know what I was gonna say.

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:43.393
I'll take a long fallow.

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:45.583
Long is even worse.

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:47.773
Yeah we're gonna talk about--

00:00:47.773 --> 00:00:50.670
Fallow is when you don't
plant anything in the field.

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:51.980
Right, it has been fallow.

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:53.240
There's been nothin' planted on the--

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:55.760
Not barren but fallow
because barren would be--

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:57.170
Intentionally left--
That it never produced

00:00:57.170 --> 00:00:59.280
anything but it produced a lot of things.

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:01.070
Yeah and so you leave it.

00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:03.740
Fallow, it's called crop rotation.

00:01:03.740 --> 00:01:05.790
Well, no, crop rotation's
when you plant something

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:06.623
different.
Well but is it--

00:01:06.623 --> 00:01:08.449
And then it restores
nutrients to the soil.

00:01:08.449 --> 00:01:10.330
Isn't nothing something?

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:13.274
Weeds, like weeds grow up in a field and

00:01:13.274 --> 00:01:14.107
stuff like that.
For those of you

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:15.660
who are confused, we're
talking about the fact that

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:18.590
we are launching, very soon, vlogs on the

00:01:18.590 --> 00:01:20.150
Rhett and Link channel, what we call

00:01:20.150 --> 00:01:21.690
the main channel forever.

00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:23.673
Every Saturday, we're gonna be doin' that.

00:01:23.673 --> 00:01:25.170
We're gonna be talking
about what went into

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:27.323
that decision and what you can expect.

00:01:28.265 --> 00:01:32.570
It is a little bit odd to
start the year talking about

00:01:34.550 --> 00:01:38.140
why we're making a particular decision.

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:38.973
But it's such a, you know what?

00:01:38.973 --> 00:01:42.010
That's what 2020's about,
it's about making decisions.

00:01:42.010 --> 00:01:45.050
I think one, we're very
excited about it but two,

00:01:45.050 --> 00:01:47.976
I think it was a big decision so it's,

00:01:47.976 --> 00:01:51.320
and nothing's out yet
so it still seems like,

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:54.640
oh, what's gonna be over
there, why are you doing this?

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:57.570
It's kind of our only
New Year's resolution.

00:01:57.570 --> 00:01:59.970
I don't have any other
resolutions besides that.

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:05.741
We're just gonna talk about
our intention to have--

00:02:05.741 --> 00:02:08.084
Yeah, I think it's a big deal.

00:02:08.084 --> 00:02:08.917
To have them.

00:02:08.917 --> 00:02:10.580
It's not just doing
something on that channel

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:13.650
but deciding to do vlog,
deciding to shoot it

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:15.950
in the way we're gonna shooted it.

00:02:15.950 --> 00:02:18.230
Yeah we're gonna shooted it.

00:02:18.230 --> 00:02:20.273
I don't know everything that
we're gonna talk about--

00:02:20.273 --> 00:02:21.270
Yeah we'll get into it.
But I think

00:02:21.270 --> 00:02:24.150
because there's so much
involved that went into the

00:02:24.150 --> 00:02:27.760
decision and there's so
much excitement from us

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:31.240
and hopefully from a lot
of mythical beasts that

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:33.680
is worth talking about,
I will say next week

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:36.980
we'll be talking about our holidays.

00:02:36.980 --> 00:02:39.983
Yeah.
Our separate but equal.

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:42.083
Well.
I don't know

00:02:42.083 --> 00:02:43.330
if they're equal.
Speak for yourself.

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:47.530
Our different but definitely
need to update each other

00:02:47.530 --> 00:02:51.063
