holiday so that'll be next week.

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:56.580
But this week it's more just
like, the creative juices are,

00:02:56.580 --> 00:02:59.320
they're electrified,
it's like we're on the

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.890
