00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:31.140
You gonna do an ad?
The vlog of 2020.

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:32.330
You're not about to do an ad.

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:33.430
I'm not, I gonna do a--

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:35.570
I feel like people already
hit the skip button

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:37.440
when you said, "But before we,"

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:38.920
you know, that's the
moment people are like

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:41.070
