actually do wanna hear.

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:55.600
I like our ads, I like to listen to 'em.

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:57.540
I have a--
They're valuable.

00:03:57.540 --> 00:04:00.763
I've had an interaction with my neighbor.

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:03.760
That I thought since--
Okay.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:06.460
This is a thing that we do
now, we update each other

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:09.450
