00:04:10.287 --> 00:04:11.691
I thought I would do that.

00:04:11.691 --> 00:04:13.760
So tree neighbor?

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:14.900
No, different.

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:15.900
Different?

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:18.880
This is a neighbor I didn't
know I had. Let me explain.

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:20.440
I haven't thought about how
I'm gonna tell the story but I

