that under perform just

00:40:06.280 --> 00:40:08.700
because they didn't meet the
expectations of the channel.

00:40:08.700 --> 00:40:11.290
Not because they didn't
meet expectations of quality

00:40:11.290 --> 00:40:13.050
or entertainment, or you didn't like it.

00:40:13.050 --> 00:40:15.220
Yeah.
You know, so it's,

00:40:15.220 --> 00:40:17.900
that was one part of it,
another things was, we did

00:40:18.850 --> 00:40:21.740
